    "created_at": "2023-11-06T20:03:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-11-06T20:03:55Z",
    "body": "I think the problem is in [IdnaTestV2.txt](https://unicode.org/Public/idna/15.1.0/IdnaTestV2.txt) (from Unicode 15.1). The test you mention is missing the `V4` label. There should be:\r\n```\r\nxn--xn--a--gua.pt; xn--a-ä.pt; [V2, V4]; xn--xn--a--gua.pt; ; ;  # xn--a-ä.pt\r\n```\r\nThis is related to: #603",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
